OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day for most,
OL,6,Fthough the sunshine turning hazy at
OL,7,Ftimes as cloud increases through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Perhaps an isolated heavy
OL,9,For thundery shower possible. Feeling
OL,10,Fhot once again, with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally dry, with clear
OL,13,Fspells. A few showers remain possible,
OL,14,Fperhaps on the heavy side. Remaining
OL,15,Fwarm in urban areas, with a light
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
