OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FDry and bright for many,
OL,6,Fwith plenty of sunshine by the
OL,7,Fafternoon. Perhaps the odd light
OL,8,Fshower early morning. A pleasant
OL,9,Ffeeling day, with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday. Gradually turning cloudy
OL,14,Fthrough Tuesday, with the chance of
OL,15,Fshowers in places. Temperatures nearer
OL,16,Fto average, but still on the warm side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
